    "created_at": "2022-05-11T09:43:27Z",
    "updated_at": "2022-05-11T09:43:27Z",
    "body": "I think I saw that anonymous iframes also offers a new request header. That should maybe be discussed at the same time as well as whether we want to expose this state to service workers through the `Request` object? As in, ideally these all have somewhat compatible shapes and extension points.",
